This is a known bug with vanilla; lizard corpses cure more than just
stoning, but the message for monsters eating a lizard corpse always
assumes that it is being eaten to cure stoning, so it displays "foo is
slowing down".

Most often, the monster has been stunned by something (you mention
Magicbane here), and this is what it's eating the lizard corpse to cure.

